 "summary": "No new declaration duplicates Mathlib or EpsilonEridani material: `MomentumSumRule` is the roadmap-specified predicate on `Frag` (the only analogue, `PDF.SumRuleAssumptions.momentum`, is a flavour sum over `Pdf`), `extendByZero` is the first named `[0,1]`-indicator combinator (existing uses in `Parton/PDF/Model.lean:84` and `DIS/Polarized/SumRules.lean:323` are inline), and no power-law moment computation exists upstream. Proofs reuse the located Mathlib API (`intervalIntegrable_inv_iff`, `integral_pow`, `integral_Icc_eq_integral_Ioc`, `Continuous.integrableOn_Icc`, `Finset.single_le_sum`).",
